$prompt = <<'PROMPT_9AD2_2DD6';
<p>9ad2_2dd6</p> <h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #536719;">Gene K</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #536719;"><i>knotted</i></span>' phenotype. A budding yeast that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #536719;">Gene K</span> cells grow in twisted, coiled shapes, resulting in a knotted or gnarled appearance.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #13668a;">Gene N</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #13668a;"><i>nude</i></span>' phenotype. A budding yeast that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #13668a;">Gene N</span> cells have an unusually smooth surface with no visible external features or textures.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black; width: 400px; height: 220px;"><tr> <th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;">Set #</th> <th colspan="4" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;">Tetrad Genotypes</th> <th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;">Progeny<br/>Count</th></tr><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;">1</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px; padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;"><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #6a5f15;">+</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #1c6b66;">+</span></td></tr></table></div></span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px; padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;"><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #6a5f15;">+</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #1c6b66;">+</span></td></tr></table></div></span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px; padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;"><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 0px; background-color: #cedf88"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace;">k</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 0px; background-color: #84e7f7"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace;">n</span></td></tr></table></div></span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px; padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;"><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 0px; background-color: #cedf88"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace;">k</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 0px; background-color: #84e7f7"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace;">n</span></td></tr></table></div></span></td> <td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;">1,815</span></td></tr><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;">2</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><div style="padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px;"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px; padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 50px;"><tr> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #6a5f15;">+</span></td> <td align="center" style="border: 0px;"><span style="font-size: large; font-family: monospace; color: #1c6b66;">+</span></td